{{ name }} at {{ ip }} — point it at SIEMBOX's syslog listener

SIEMBOX already listens for syslog on {{ siembox_port }}/udp and /tcp -- no
SIEMBOX-side configuration is needed. On {{ name }} itself, set the remote
syslog target to:

  Host:     {{ siembox_host }}
  Port:     {{ siembox_port }}
  Protocol: UDP (TCP also accepted)

Once configured, check the Logs view for entries from {{ ip }} within a few
minutes. If nothing arrives, confirm {{ ip }} can reach {{ siembox_host }} on
{{ siembox_port }} and that {{ name }}'s syslog client is actually enabled.
